      "text": "@Samuel\n [CTGP], \nServer Tag: CTGP\nCTGP\nI have a question regarding WR tracking: will WRs set after the shutdown be tracked still or no? There's an offline version by modders in the works that includes QoL improvements to TTs, the biggest one being the ability to select any DKG combo on every track to TT, including R, T, RT, and tracks previously not selected for TT challenges.\nJimmy\n — \n8/29/26, 7:23 AM\nSaturday, August 29, 2026 at 7:23 AM\nThe current plan is to archive all submissions once MKT ends. Unless there is a lot of activity on the offline version, those records won’t be tracked here"
